/*--------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
/*------------------------- File ZigguratTables.tpp ------------------------*/
/*--------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
/** @file
 * The tables of the ziggurats of normalZiggurat() and exponentialZiggurat()
 * [see RandomGenerators.h], 256 strips of area v under the decreasing
 * density f, from the right end r of the base strip (the values of
 * Marsaglia and Tsang): x[ 0 ] = v / f( r ), the width of a rectangle of
 * the area of the base strip with its tail, x[ 1 ] = r, \f$ x_{i+1} =
 * f^{-1}( f( x_i ) + v / x_i ) \f$ and x[ 256 ] = 0; y[ i ] = f( x[ i ] )
 * (with y[ 0 ] = f( r )), and k[ i ] = x[ i + 1 ] / x[ i ], the part of the
 * strip i under the next one. They were computed in decimal arithmetic of
 * 60 digits and rounded to the nearest double once, so that the recurrence
 * does not pile up the roundings of the doubles.
 *
 * \author Donato Meoli \n
 *         Dipartimento di Informatica \n
 *         Universita' di Pisa \n
 *
 * \copyright &copy; by Donato Meoli
 */
/*--------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
/*-------------------------- IMPLEMENTATION --------------------------------*/
/*--------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

